{
 "title": "Does the ARE peak in Germany come at the same time every year?",
 "subtitle": "Before 2020 the peak came every year in ISO weeks 5-12 (Feb-Mar); since COVID-19 its timing varies (December peaks in 2022 and 2023). Data: RKI, CC BY 4.0",
 "arrangement": "vertical",
 "spacing": 12,
